        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Rehnquist, chief Justice Rehnquist announced the hearing for No.\u202f99\u20111823, Equal Employment Opportunity Commission v. Waffle House, Inc."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
