            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Paul D. Clement, the EEOC can bring a public enforcement action against Waffle House that is independent of any arbitration agreement between Waffle House and Eric Baker."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Paul D. Clement",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "414632c01a7decef6f679163735a9b1420f98c250211cbb592f5c64c44af886c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-414632c01a7d-0000-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 8,
              "start": 8
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Paul D. Clement, the EEOC selected this case to clarify employers' obligations under the ADA, which was newly enacted at the time the events occurred in 1994."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Mr. Gordon",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "414632c01a7decef6f679163735a9b1420f98c250211cbb592f5c64c44af886c",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-414632c01a7d-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 38,
              "start": 38
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Mr. Gordon, there is a strong federal policy favoring arbitration, as reflected in the Federal Arbitration Act."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Overview",
    "status": "complete",
    "summary": null,
    "summary_citations": []
